{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37993","headline":"雪中过重湖信笔偶题 · 韩偓","name":"雪中过重湖信笔偶题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道方时险拟如何，谪去甘心隐薜萝。\n青草湖将天暗合，白头浪与雪相和。\n旗亭腊酎踰年熟，水国春寒向晚多。\n处困不忙仍不怨，醉来唯是欲傞傞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}